=2 Walkthrough
!Jugner Forest (S) Logging Map.PNG|right|Jugner Forest (S) Logging map
* Talk to Rholont in Southern San d'Oria (S) (E-7) to receive a {@k} {k:Letter to Count Aurchiat}.
** May have to speak to {n:Rholont} more than once to trigger cutscene.
** If you don't have {i:Hatchets|Hatchet|1021}, buy them from {n:Geltpix} at (M-6) now to save time, because you'll need them for this quest.
* Head back to {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} and examine the **Shimmering Pondweed** at (G-6) again for a cutscene.
** Using the Campaign teleport will most likely be your fastest way here.
** The next closest method is teleporting to the Survival Guide in {z:Rolanberry Fields (S)}, which will put you right at the top zone line for Pashhow Marshlands (S).
** The quest will now be flagged in your log.
* Travel to {z:Jugner Forest (S)} and examine the **Overgrown Mushrooms** at (F-10) for a cutscene. (They are on the pathway.)
** {i:Recall ring: Jugner|Jugner Ring|15841} or {s:Recall-Jugner} will get you close to where you are going the fastest. The Survival Guide is also a good option.
** **{c=red:Note:}** Have at least one open inventory slot or you will have to rewatch the entire CS again.
* Use {i:Hatchets|Hatchet|1021} on __Logging Points__ in the area until you receive a {@k} {k:Length of Jugner Ivy|Length of Jugner ivy}.
** The chance of getting the Length of Jugner Ivy from a logging point is high, but not 100%.
** If you're struggling to get it, fill your inventory completely and the game will be forced to give you the key item.
** Logging points are around (F-7) (F-10) (J-6) and (J/K - 10/11); see the map on the right.
* Return to the **Overgrown Mushrooms** at (F-10) in {z:Jugner Forest (S)} for another cutscene.
* Travel to the lower right corner of (F-7) and check the **Mossy Stump** for a cutscene.
* After the cutscene, inspect the **Mossy Stump** again to enter a battlefield against a {m:Young Behemoth}.
** See the {p:Discussion|Talk:Bonds That Never Die} page for testimonials and boss-related information.
* After you have cleared the battlefield, report to {n:Rongelouts N Distaud} (S) (I-9) in {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} to receive your reward.

To continue with missions: After receiving your reward from {n:Rongelouts N Distaud} (S), zone into {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} from {z:East Ronfaure (S)} for a cutscene that completes {M:Crossroads of Time|Crossroads of Time|Crossroads of Time} and starts {M:Sandswept Memories|Sandswept Memories|Sandswept Memories}.
\**Note:** You will need to wait until the next Vana'diel day, have zoned, and be on the quest {M:Fate in Haze|Fate in Haze|Fate in Haze} to continue to progress your nation's story after completing this quest.
